# Tackl Type Imports

Always import typography styles from `@tackl/type`. Never use `@/theme/tackl/type`.

```typescript
// ❌ BAD
import { headlineL, bodyM } from '@/theme/tackl/type';

// ✅ GOOD
import { headlineL, bodyM } from '@tackl/type';
```

When editing existing files, replace any `@/theme/tackl/type` imports with `@tackl/type`.

Note: `@tackl` (or `@theme/tackl` / `@/theme/tackl`) remains valid for Tackl primitives and utilities (e.g. the polymorphic `Div`, `getBrand`, `bp`). `Div` is the only semantic component — per-tag components like `Section` or `H1` do not exist. This rule applies only to typography from the `type` module.
